  "keyFeatures": [
    "Drag-and-drop Blockly workspace for visual programming",
    "Multi-mode editor supporting Block, Mix (split), and Code views",
    "Support for Arduino (AVR, ESP32, ESP8266), MicroPython (ESP32, K210, micro:bit), and Python boards",
    "Integrated serial monitor with real-time chart plotting",
    "Library manager for importing and managing third-party Mixly, Arduino, and Python libraries",
    "Board manager for adding and removing hardware board packages",
    "Light and dark theme with system-follow option",
    "Multi-language support (English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese)",
    "Web (browser) and Electron (desktop) deployment modes",
    "WebSerial and WebUSB support for in-browser firmware flashing",
    "Toolbox search and workspace find across block categories",
    "Tabbed file management with .mix file save/open"
  ],
